# Runtime data written by ASTPP. The directories belong to the tree (installer/deploy keep
# their content), generated files never do. Files already tracked here stay tracked.
/web_interface/astpp/upload/*
/web_interface/astpp/attachments/*
/web_interface/astpp/invoices/*
/web_interface/astpp/database_backup/*
/web_interface/astpp/language/*
/web_interface/astpp/assets/captcha/*.jpg
/web_interface/astpp/assets/Rates_File/uploaded_files/
/web_interface/astpp/application/cache/*
/web_interface/astpp/application/logs/*
/freeswitch/scripts/astpp/lib/addons/*
/freeswitch/fs/lib/addons/*
